This project implements its own final-answer extraction, frozen subset selection,
unit-aware scoring, lifecycle management, and offline reporting. It is not an
official leaderboard or a distribution of the full VLMEvalKit source tree.

MMStar, BLINK, OCRBench, ChartQA, POPE, MVBench, and all referenced models remain
subject to their publishers' terms. No source dataset media or model weights
are included. Dataset source repositories and pinned revisions are in configs/.
Synthetic demo assets are generated by this project's own code.
